{
  "title": "Route 53 · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "DNS 질의와 헬스 체크, 라우팅 정책을 제공한다.",
  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>Route 53</span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/#hosted-zones-and-dns-records\">Hosted Zones and DNS Records</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/#alias-records\">Alias Records</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/#simple-routing\">Simple Routing</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/#weighted-routing\">Weighted Routing</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/#latency-based-routing\">Latency-based Routing</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/#failover-routing\">Failover Routing</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/#geolocation-routing\">Geolocation Routing</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/#geoproximity-routing\">Geoproximity Routing</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/#ip-based-routing\">IP-based Routing</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/#multivalue-answer-routing\">Multivalue Answer Routing</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/#health-checks-and-resolver\">Health Checks and Resolver</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>네트워크</span><span>42 / 62</span></div><h1>Route 53</h1><p class=\"article-date\">공식 문서 확인 2026-09-30 · 11 subtopics</p></header><section id=\"overview\" class=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>Route 53은 Domain Registration, Authoritative DNS <span class=\"full-name\">(Domain Name System)</span>, Health Check와 DNS <span class=\"full-name\">(Domain Name System)</span> Routing을 제공한다. DNS <span class=\"full-name\">(Domain Name System)</span> 응답으로 주소를 선택한 뒤 실제 HTTP <span class=\"full-name\">(Hypertext Transfer Protocol)</span> 요청은 Client가 서버나 Load Balancer에 직접 보낸다.</p><p>Reverse Proxy처럼 HTTP <span class=\"full-name\">(Hypertext Transfer Protocol)</span> Payload를 전달하는 서비스가 아니다. DNS <span class=\"full-name\">(Domain Name System)</span> Failover는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#dynamodb-streams-and-ttl\">TTL</a>과 Client·Resolver의 Cache 영향을 받으므로 즉시 모든 연결을 바꾸는 것으로 이해하면 안 된다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" aria-label=\"DNS 응답과 실제 요청 경로\"><figure class=\"diagram\"><figcaption><b>DNS 응답과 실제 요청 경로</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><div class=\"visual-lanes\"><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Name resolution</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Client DNS <span class=\"full-name\">(Domain Name System)</span> query</strong><small>도메인 조회</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong>Route 53 policy</strong><small>Record·Health·Routing 평가</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>DNS <span class=\"full-name\">(Domain Name System)</span> answer</strong><small>Alias 또는 주소 응답</small></div></div><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Application traffic</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Client</strong><small>받은 주소로 직접 연결</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/\">CloudFront</a> / <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#application-load-balancer\">ALB</a> / Server</strong><small>실제 HTTP <span class=\"full-name\">(Hypertext Transfer Protocol)</span>·TCP <span class=\"full-name\">(Transmission Control Protocol)</span> 요청 처리</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Response</strong><small>Route 53이 Proxy하지 않음</small></div></div></div><p class=\"diagram-note\">DNS <span class=\"full-name\">(Domain Name System)</span> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#dynamodb-streams-and-ttl\">TTL</a>·Client Cache 때문에 DNS <span class=\"full-name\">(Domain Name System)</span> 변경이 모든 연결에 즉시 적용되지는 않는다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"hosted-zones-and-dns-records\"><h2>Hosted Zones and DNS <span class=\"full-name\">(Domain Name System)</span> Records<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/#hosted-zones-and-dns-records\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/#hosted-zones-and-dns-records\">Public Hosted Zone</a>은 인터넷 DNS <span class=\"full-name\">(Domain Name System)</span>에, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/#hosted-zones-and-dns-records\">Private Hosted Zone</a>은 연결된 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a>의 이름 조회에 사용한다. A·AAAA·CNAME 등의 Record가 대상 주소·이름을 지정한다. Domain 등록과 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/#hosted-zones-and-dns-records\">Hosted Zone</a> 생성, Registrar의 Name Server 설정은 별도 작업이다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"alias-records\"><h2>Alias Records<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/#alias-records\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>지원 AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span> Resource를 Alias Target으로 지정한다. Zone Apex에서도 사용할 수 있으며 CNAME과 제약이 다르다. 대상별 지원과 Evaluate Target Health 동작을 확인한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"simple-routing\"><h2>Simple Routing<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/#simple-routing\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>단순 DNS <span class=\"full-name\">(Domain Name System)</span> 응답에 사용한다. 하나의 Record에 여러 값이 있더라도 고급 Health 기반 Failover 정책과 같은 기능으로 간주하지 않는다. 단일 서비스의 기본 이름 연결에서 시작하는 정책이다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"weighted-routing\"><h2>Weighted Routing<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/#weighted-routing\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Record별 Weight 비율에 따라 DNS <span class=\"full-name\">(Domain Name System)</span> 응답을 분배한다. 점진 배포나 Traffic Migration에 활용한다. 비율은 DNS <span class=\"full-name\">(Domain Name System)</span> 응답 선택 기준이므로 모든 HTTP <span class=\"full-name\">(Hypertext Transfer Protocol)</span> 요청이 정확히 같은 비율로 배분되는 것을 보장하지 않는다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"latency-based-routing\"><h2>Latency-based Routing<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/#latency-based-routing\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>사용자의 위치에서 지연이 낮은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a>의 리소스를 선택하도록 구성한다. 단순 지도상의 최단 거리와 같은 규칙은 아니다. 다중 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a> 서비스의 사용자 지연 최적화에 사용한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"failover-routing\"><h2>Failover Routing<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/#failover-routing\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Primary·Secondary 대상과 Health 상태를 이용한다. 장애 감지 후 DNS <span class=\"full-name\">(Domain Name System)</span> 응답을 바꾸지만 기존 연결과 Cache는 남을 수 있다. 실제 복구 시간에는 Health 감지와 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#dynamodb-streams-and-ttl\">TTL</a>·Client 재시도가 모두 포함된다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"geolocation-routing\"><h2>Geolocation Routing<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/#geolocation-routing\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>사용자의 국가·대륙 등 위치별로 응답을 고른다. 콘텐츠 지역화나 위치에 따른 서비스 제공에 사용한다. 명시적으로 일치하지 않는 요청을 위한 Default Record도 준비한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"geoproximity-routing\"><h2>Geoproximity Routing<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/#geoproximity-routing\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Resource와 사용자 위치의 지리적 근접성을 기준으로 선택하고 Bias로 대상의 영향 영역을 조정한다. Geolocation의 국가별 고정 규칙과 다르다. 위치·Bias 설정과 Traffic 정책을 확인한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"ip-based-routing\"><h2>IP <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol)</span>-based Routing<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/#ip-based-routing\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Client IP <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol)</span> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">CIDR</a>에 따른 응답 규칙을 정의한다. 특정 ISP나 고객 Network의 경로 최적화에 활용한다. 사용자의 실제 주소와 DNS <span class=\"full-name\">(Domain Name System)</span> Resolver에서 식별되는 주소의 차이를 고려한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"multivalue-answer-routing\"><h2>Multivalue Answer Routing<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/#multivalue-answer-routing\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>여러 Health한 IP <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol)</span> 응답을 제공해 Client가 선택할 수 있게 한다. Load Balancer의 연결 분산·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/acm/\">TLS</a> 종료를 대신하지 않는다. 개별 Record의 Health Check를 연결해 비정상 대상을 제외할 수 있다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"health-checks-and-resolver\"><h2>Health Checks and Resolver<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/#health-checks-and-resolver\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Health Check는 Endpoint·Metric·계산된 상태 등을 검사한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/#health-checks-and-resolver\">Route 53 Resolver</a> Inbound·Outbound Endpoint는 Hybrid DNS <span class=\"full-name\">(Domain Name System)</span> 조회에 사용한다. DNS <span class=\"full-name\">(Domain Name System)</span> 이름 조회와 HTTP <span class=\"full-name\">(Hypertext Transfer Protocol)</span> 서비스 상태 검사를 별도 기능으로 구분한다.</p></section><section id=\"scenario\" class=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>Seoul과 다른 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a>에 서비스를 준비한 뒤 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/#failover-routing\">Failover Routing</a>을 쓰더라도 데이터 복제와 앱 전환이 준비되지 않으면 DNS <span class=\"full-name\">(Domain Name System)</span>만 바꾸어 정상 서비스로 복구할 수 없다.</p></section><aside class=\"tip\"><b>시험에서 구별할 점</b><p>HTTP <span class=\"full-name\">(Hypertext Transfer Protocol)</span> 요청 본문을 받아 대신 전달하는 리버스 프록시가 아니다.</p></aside><section id=\"references\" class=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><p>위 첨자는 아래 공식 문서로 연결됩니다. 서비스 제공 조건은 확인일 기준입니다.</p><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/Route53/latest/DeveloperGuide/Welcome.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Route53/latest/DeveloperGuide/Welcome.html ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section id=\"practice\" class=\"related-questions\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q023/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q023\" data-question=\"Q023\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q023</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q023/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company wants DNS responses for a domain to switch to another Region based on health checks. Which service is central to this design?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q023\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon Route 53</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q023\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS KMS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q023\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon SQS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q023\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EBS</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">Route 53</a>의 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">DNS</a> 헬스 체크와 장애 조치 라우팅 정책을 쓴다. 클라이언트 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cache/\">캐시</a> 때문에 전환은 즉시 완료되지 않을 수 있다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">Route 53</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/\">RPO / RTO</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q024\" data-question=\"Q024\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q024</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q024/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Requests to /api and /images on the same domain must be routed to different backends based on their HTTP paths. Which load balancer type should be used?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q024\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Application Load Balancer</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q024\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Network ACL</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q024\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Route 53 alone</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q024\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EBS</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#application-load-balancer\">ALB</a>는 경로 기반 HTTP <span class=\"full-name\">(Hypertext Transfer Protocol)</span> 라우팅을 지원한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">DNS</a>만으로 HTTP <span class=\"full-name\">(Hypertext Transfer Protocol)</span> 경로를 해석하지 않는다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/\">ELB / ALB / NLB</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">Route 53</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q082\" data-question=\"Q082\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q082</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q082/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A design serves private S3 objects through CloudFront using a domain name. Which service-to-role mapping is correct?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q082\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Route 53 provides DNS, CloudFront delivers content, and S3 stores objects</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q082\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 performs HTTP path-based load balancing</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q082\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Route 53 caches S3 objects</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q082\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">CloudFront grants IAM roles</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">DNS</a> 응답과 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/\">CDN</a> 캐싱, 객체 저장은 각 서비스의 다른 역할이다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">Route 53</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/\">CloudFront</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q001\" data-question=\"Q001\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q001</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q001/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An application must remain available during a prolonged outage of the entire Seoul Region. What is the minimum scope for replication?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q001\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A different AWS Region</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q001\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">A different subnet in the Seoul Region</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q001\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">A different Availability Zone in the Seoul Region</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q001\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">A different ENI in the same Availability Zone</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> 분리는 한 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">리전</a> 안의 장애를 다룬다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">리전</a> 수준 장애는 별도 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">리전</a> 복제와 전환이 필요하다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/\">RPO / RTO</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q093\" data-question=\"Q093\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0,2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q093</span><span class=\"type-label\">2개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q093/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Which TWO targets must be established for a database recovery strategy that withstands a Region outage?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q093\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Recovery time objective (RTO)</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q093\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Only the network ACL rule number</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q093\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Recovery point objective (RPO)</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q093\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">The color of the AMI</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q093\" value=\"4\"><span class=\"option-letter\">E</span><span lang=\"en\">The length of an Elastic IP address name</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A, C</strong> · 허용 데이터 손실과 복구 시간을 목표로 정해야 복제·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/\">백업</a> 전략을 선택할 수 있다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/\">RPO / RTO</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/\">AWS Backup</a></div></article></section><nav class=\"sequence\" aria-label=\"용어 이동\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">이전 용어 <b>Region</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">다음 용어 <b>Route Table</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
